    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20453" root="سلع" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلْعَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A wound by which the head is broken,</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَجَّةٌ</span>, (S, L, Mgh, Msb, K,) <i>of whatever
kind it be;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلَعَةٌ</span></b> : or <i>that</i> [<i>only</i>] <i>cleaves
the skin:</i> (K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلَعَاتٌ</span> (Msb, K, [in the CK,
erroneously, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلْعَاتٌ</span>,]) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِلَاعٌ</span>, and quasi-pl. n.
[or coll. gen. n.] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلَعٌ</span>. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also what
next follows.

